  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multipurpose Cash &amp; Winterisation Support for floods affected population in Baluchistan and Sindh provinces.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aims to support most vulnerable families (including women specially Persons with Disability / gender and religious minorities) and children under 5 through Multipurpose Cash Assistance (MPCA) and provisions of in-kind support through winterisation kits in Lasbella, Khairpur and Dadu districts of Balochistan and Sindh provinces.</narrative>
  </description>
